{"lines":[{"y":0.042151163079239051,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"x":0.087378637879196877,"w":0.1165048599243164,"t":"Introduction"},{"h":0.022121481732044646,"y":0.087586969729844588,"w":0.085733445485432949,"c":1,"x":0.08839310405659366,"t":"Writing"},{"h":0.020004954590604362,"y":0.11439609465413481,"c":1,"x":0.091173370062685416,"t":"This test consists of two tasks. It is suggested that candidates spend about 20 minutes on","w":0.805994873046875},{"c":1,"h":0.021175555648090705,"y":0.13317807416257299,"t":"Task 1, which requires them to write at least 150 words, and 40 minutes on Task 2, which","w":0.80409408569335949,"x":0.091161451799012624},{"w":0.82542653401692712,"h":0.019820778392185656,"c":1,"y":0.1518206755276954,"x":0.089220566801372081,"t":"requires them to write at least 250 words. Task 2 contributes twice as much as Task 1 to the"},{"h":0.0162648899161556,"x":0.089152070246467291,"c":1,"t":"Writing score.","y":0.1745792567029667,"w":0.12857107798258463},{"t":"Task 1 requires candidates to look at a diagram or some data (in a graph, table or chart)","h":0.018905729965257523,"y":0.19000296241440973,"w":0.79235305786132815,"c":1,"x":0.11063170341952325},{"c":1,"x":0.089320377704027773,"w":0.77864079793294272,"y":0.20930232546702343,"t":"and to present the information in their own words. They are assessed on their ability to","h":0.017488951994994006},{"x":0.091108160171058231,"w":0.81195332845052071,"h":0.023331525095526717,"c":1,"t":"organise, present and possibly compare data, and are required to describe the stages of a","y":0.22576285460472567},{"h":0.019511983996239879,"t":"process, describe an object or event, or explain how something works.","y":0.24689449230035598,"c":1,"w":0.63516789754231773,"x":0.091127691507717726},{"t":"In Task 2, candidates are presented with a point of view, argument or problem. They are","y":0.26419830338989314,"x":0.10867258742684442,"w":0.79435195922851565,"h":0.021383120337750694,"c":1},{"y":0.28308687708150959,"w":0.82534800211588544,"h":0.019895718773577542,"x":0.091196916586725366,"c":1,"t":"assessed on their ability to present a solution to the problem, present and justify an opinion,"},{"t":"compare and contrast evidence and opinions, and evaluate and challenge ideas, evidence","y":0.30165693246158387,"c":1,"x":0.091155812721977064,"h":0.02145424483349756,"w":0.81187311808268237},{"c":1,"t":"or arguments.","w":0.13063772837320964,"x":0.090936025744871363,"y":0.32369843687338629,"h":0.017282045073227059},{"w":0.73992736816406246,"x":0.1125657235288864,"h":0.019464674619870781,"c":1,"t":"Candidates are also assessed on their ability to write in an appropriate style. More","y":0.33932139589758958},{"w":0.77685399373372399,"x":0.089247682991029462,"c":1,"t":"information on assessing the Writing test, including Writing assessment criteria (public","y":0.35810326362882783,"h":0.020984575978692077},{"c":1,"h":0.017524270030939704,"x":0.089320393913891016,"w":0.29514561971028647,"y":0.37936046499655229,"t":"version), is available at ielts.org."},{"t":"Speaking","y":0.41133720916882899,"w":0.104854367574056,"x":0.091262136473574978,"c":1,"h":0.017441860686210009},{"t":"This test takes between 11 and 14 minutes and is conducted by a trained examiner.","w":0.75357121785481773,"h":0.020696098113728412,"c":1,"x":0.091165827125541998,"y":0.43396020562783422},{"w":0.20000000000000001,"t":"There are three parts:","x":0.091262135816891146,"y":0.45638629308962542,"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1},{"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"Part 1","c":1,"y":0.48691588770014693,"w":0.058252429962158209,"x":0.093203882009212174},{"x":0.09116684552960351,"y":0.50645709461461075,"w":0.79633046468098956,"h":0.020498317350108319,"c":1,"t":"The candidate and the examiner introduce themselves. Candidates then answer general"},{"x":0.09307073213162681,"w":0.809952596028646,"h":0.021115516353619079,"t":"questions about themselves, their home\/family, their job\/studies, their interests and a wide","c":1,"y":0.52513747090567942},{"y":0.54371048075059725,"w":0.73997777303059897,"t":"range of similar familiar topic areas. This part lasts between four and five minutes.","x":0.091155516832575362,"h":0.020421552806628496,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.060194174448649093,"t":"Part 2","y":0.57848837237196704,"x":0.093203883552374509,"h":0.014658044951727067},{"w":0.80206995646158852,"x":0.091189101790755747,"h":0.019974762628382936,"c":1,"y":0.59761923943917772,"t":"The candidate is given a task card with prompts and is asked to talk on a particular topic."},{"y":0.61773255801253335,"w":0.77281555175781258,"c":1,"h":0.017469934362488782,"t":"The candidate has one minute to prepare and they can make some notes if they wish,","x":0.093203875126772473},{"x":0.093110669224184997,"t":"before speaking for between one and two minutes. The examiner then asks one or two","y":0.63485159872375729,"w":0.7788420104980468,"h":0.021335349870247988,"c":1},{"t":"questions on the same topic.","c":1,"y":0.65572658027739383,"w":0.26237480163574217,"x":0.093055743551779771,"h":0.018759449397292127},{"w":0.058252429962158209,"h":0.014680685358255507,"x":0.095145629585623503,"y":0.68750000027708758,"c":1,"t":"Part 3"},{"h":0.019562367115436685,"c":1,"x":0.09314003625479178,"y":0.70826588733010643,"w":0.81372817993164048,"t":"The examiner and the candidate engage in a discussion of more abstract issues which are"},{"t":"thematically linked to the topic in Part 2. The discussion lasts between four and five minutes.","w":0.83315689086914058,"y":0.72623651246448651,"h":0.019840535196559816,"x":0.093109135408984689,"c":1},{"h":0.020213980986693247,"y":0.74486684793431168,"t":"The Speaking test assesses whether candidates can communicate effectively in English.","c":1,"x":0.11641294302698232,"w":0.79821782430013022},{"t":"The assessment takes into account Fluency and Coherence, Lexical Resource, Grammatical","x":0.095057982010094508,"y":0.76411455770430325,"h":0.020476940784870279,"w":0.83514109293619798,"c":1},{"h":0.020954630010967312,"y":0.78222679649680826,"c":1,"w":0.81957585652669263,"t":"Range and Accuracy, and Pronunciation. More information on assessing the Speaking test,","x":0.095047139061740421},{"h":0.02101596226201996,"y":0.80094844065725113,"t":"including Speaking assessment criteria (public version), is available at ielts.org.","x":0.09310421785533872,"c":1,"w":0.71667668660481765},{"y":0.95930232538947346,"w":0.013592232068379728,"h":0.013081395514657479,"t":"6","c":1,"x":0.095145631457719537}],"w":2400,"h":3209}